WEBVTT

00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:31.752
and put down a stake,

00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:33.288
and wherever they put down that stake,

00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:34.996
that was their new home.

00:00:34.996 --> 00:00:37.366
And at the end of the very first day,

00:00:37.366 --> 00:00:39.116
the population of Oklahoma City

00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:43.022
had gone from zero to 10,000,

00:00:43.022 --> 00:00:44.363
and our planning department

00:00:44.363 --> 00:00:48.283
is still paying for that.

00:00:48.283 --> 00:00:50.780
The citizens got together on that first day

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.032
and elected a mayor.

00:00:53.032 --> 00:00:54.839
And then they shot him.

00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:59.488
(Laughter)

00:00:59.947 --> 00:01:02.430
That's not really all that funny